<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Uzun Hasan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1478">1478</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Uzun Hasan was the ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aq-qoyunlu">Aq Qoyunlu</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turkmen">Turkmen</a> confederation, who died in 1478. He built a powerful state in eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iraq">Iraq</a> and western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a> but was defeated by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottomans</a> at Otlukbeli in 1473. Through his daughter he was the grandfather of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ismail-i">Ismail I</a>, and accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/safavid-empire">Safavid Empire</a> discuss him in the context of the dynasty's origins.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/uzun-hasan.jpg" alt="Uzun Hasan" width="296" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 1467-1473 artist · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uzun_Hasan_on_horse,_1460s%E2%80%931470s,_Aq_Qoyunlu_ruler_Uzun_Hasa_hunting_(detail).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
